# EGCVIEW.EXE -- real np2kai capture of one frame's EGC block.
# np2ops trace (NP2_OPS) of the shipping demo running on the harness,
# frame 2: per-dot writes (ope 0x2cac, fgbg 0x40FF) plus the masked-
# sprite rows (ope 0x29ca AND + 0x29ac OR, leng 0x1F word arms, sft 0).
# A matching M 2 ahead of the E writes stands in for the mode2 EGC arm
# (the recorder only tags engine changes on memory ops).

